== 3. SMW Integration

=== 3.1 Query-to-Graph Pipeline

'''Step 1: SMW Query'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|?Has related entity
|format=json
}}
```

'''Step 2: Data Transformation'''
```javascript
function smwToGraph(smwData) {
  const nodes = smwData.results.map(result => ({
    id: result.fulltext,
    label: result.printouts["Has title"][0],
    epistemicStatus: result.printouts["Has epistemic status"][0],
    confidence: parseFloat(result.printouts["Has confidence"][0])
  }));
  
  const edges = smwData.results.flatMap(result => 
    result.printouts["Has related entity"].map(related => ({
      source: result.fulltext,
      target: related.fulltext,
      type: "related"
    }))
  );
  
  return { nodes, edges };
}
```

'''Step 3: Visualization Rendering'''
```javascript
const svg = d3.select("#graph-container")
  .append("svg")
  .attr("width", width)
  .attr("height", height);

// Render nodes and edges using D3
```

=== 3.2 Embedded Visualization

'''SMW Result Format:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::Concept]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|format=jqplotchart
|charttype=bubble
|charttitle=Concept Confidence Distribution
}}
```

'''Custom Result Format:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
