== 4. Visualization Types

=== 4.1 Entity Network

'''Purpose:''' Show relationships between entities

'''Features:'''
* Nodes = entities
* Edges = relationships
* Color = epistemic status
* Size = confidence

'''Use Case:''' Explore concept dependencies

=== 4.2 Epistemic Landscape

'''Purpose:''' Show confidence distribution

'''Features:'''
* X-axis = confidence
* Y-axis = entity count
* Color = epistemic status
* Interactive filtering

'''Use Case:''' Identify knowledge gaps

=== 4.3 Temporal Evolution

'''Purpose:''' Show knowledge development over time

'''Features:'''
* X-axis = time
* Y-axis = confidence/quality
* Animation of changes
* Version comparison

'''Use Case:''' Track epistemic progress

=== 4.4 Domain Map

'''Purpose:''' Show knowledge organization by domain

'''Features:'''
* Treemap or sunburst
* Hierarchical domains
* Entity density
* Quality heatmap

'''Use Case:''' Assess domain coverage

=== 4.5 Provenance Graph

'''Purpose:''' Show knowledge derivation

'''Features:'''
* Nodes = entities and sources
* Edges = derivation relationships
* Source quality indicators
* Verification status

'''Use Case:''' Audit knowledge origins

